{"meta":{"id":"tt13650700","type":"movie","name":"El gran viaje de tu vida","imdb_id":"tt13650700","description":"Una historia imaginativa de dos extraños y el increíble viaje que los conecta, que narra el encuentro fortuito de dos personas de mundos completamente distintos. A medida que inician un viaje juntos, se ven envueltos en situaciones extraordinarias que desafían su percepción de la realidad. A lo largo del camino, ambos descubren secretos ocultos, enfrentan sus miedos y forjan una profunda conexión que cambiará sus vidas para siempre. Un relato de transformación, aventura y la magia de los encuentros inesperados.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt13650700.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2ha0wAOqrUcLScStWQcgeOOXapQ.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6x3Im91eYD58i8Nxj6LL8xUxHpM.png","genres":["Romance","Fantasía","Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-09-17T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"139 min","imdbRating":"6.0","country":"United States of America, Ireland","cast":["Colin Farrell","Margot Robbie","Kevin Kline","Phoebe Waller-Bridge","Lily Rabe","Hamish Linklater","Jodie Turner-Smith","Chloe East","Jennifer Grant","Billy Magnussen","Sarah Gadon","Jason Kravits","Brandon Perea","Jacqueline Novak","Lucy Thomas","Mike Meldman","Calahan Skogman","Pablo Soriano","Galen Hooks","Michelle Mao","Shelby Simmons","Simon Khan","Brooke Maroon","Julian Zane","Liz Jenkins","Gabriella Surodjawan","Joyce Guy","Karah Donovan","Mia-Carina Mollicone","Yuvi Hecht"],"director":["Kogonada"],"writer":["Seth Reiss"],"trailers":[{"source":"qOhLRqePXW4","type":"Trailer","name":"Nuevo Tráiler [Subtitulado]","ytId":"qOhLRqePXW4","lang":"es"},{"source":"ZFofPqst1m8","type":"Trailer","name":"Tráiler Oficial [Subtitulado]","ytId":"ZFofPqst1m8","lang":"es"},{"source":"QuOH2kRMU1Q","type":"Trailer","name":"Trailer Oficial en Español","ytId":"QuOH2kRMU1Q","lang":"es"},{"source":"EG